flowchart LR
  PLAN[Plan and compatibility review] --> STAGE[Staging validation]
  STAGE --> BACKUP[Backup and recovery check]
  BACKUP --> UPGRADE[Control plane and add-on upgrade]
  UPGRADE --> NODES[Node pool rotation]
  NODES --> VERIFY[Workload and SLO validation]
  VERIFY -->|Healthy| COMPLETE[Close change]
  VERIFY -->|Degraded| STOP[Stop and execute recovery plan]
